Error [E3104]: `arena` was already free; this value lives in `arena` which is gone
  --> tests/ui/mem_use_after_free.jet:8:16
    |
  8 |     y @= arena.alloc(2)
    |                ^^^^^
 Why: calling `arena.free` invalidated all values allocated in `arena`
 Fix: move the `alloc` call before the `free`, or create a new allocator
